## Anti Pattern

- [ ] **Non-deterministic code**: Using random, time in workflow logic
- [ ] **Large payloads**: Passing too much data between workflow and activity
- [ ] **No timeouts**: Activities can hang forever
- [ ] **No retry**: Failing permanently on transient errors
- [ ] **Synchronous external calls**: Blocking on external systems
- [ ] **Mutable static state**: Using global variables

## Best Practice

- [ ] **Deterministic workflows**: Only use Temporal SDK functions for time/random
- [ ] **Activity heartbeating**: Long-running activities should heartbeat
- [ ] **Proper timeouts**: Always set activity timeouts
- [ ] **Retry policies**: Configure for transient failures
- [ ] **Idempotent activities**: Safe to retry
- [ ] **Async patterns**: Use signals for external events

